cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "uPULLI-I: interpretable high-throughput bacterial phenotyping from brightfield timelapse microscopy"
abstract: >-
  A high-throughput pipeline for automated brightfield timelapse microscopy of
  96-well plates. Processes per-well TIFF stacks through registration,
  segmentation, colony tracking, and colony/whole-image feature extraction, with
  a PySide6 GUI and headless CLI tools.
type: software
